    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diamond Board is a game that you can play in one sitting. With beautiful graphics and a beautiful theme song, draw cards to move while collecting currency on the board and avoid the red pawns. Buy powerups through the currency that you collect to avoid and kill the red pawns. Special thanks to prismesmusic for the theme song.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diamond Board is a game that you can play in one sitting. With beautiful graphics and a beautiful theme song, draw cards to move while collecting currency on the board and avoid the red pawns. Buy powerups through the currency that you collect to avoid and kill the red pawns. Special thanks to prismesmusic for the theme song.</p>",
    "short_description": "Collect currency around the board to hire a hitman, to learn to go backwards, to learn to attack by landing on the enemy first, and to buy property to hide. Smuggle between the hitman\u2019s house and your property or vice versa after hiring the hitman and buying the property.",
